---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Newsletter from '../components/Newsletter.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who I am and why this site exists.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head about">
      <div class="portrait" aria-hidden="true">KV<!-- Replace with <img src="/kv.jpg" alt="KV"> --></div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>I'm KV, and I like making things.</h1>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p><strong>Replace this with your story.</strong> A good about page answers three questions: who are you, what do you make, and why should a stranger care?</p>
      <p>Here's a starting draft: I'm a builder. I spend my days writing software and my evenings and weekends building side products — some useful, some silly, a few that actually make money. Mind of KV is my public notebook: the place where I document what I'm building, what I'm learning, and the ideas I can't stop thinking about.</p>
      <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Articles</strong> — essays on building products, thinking clearly and doing good work.</li>
        <li><strong>Videos</strong> — build logs, tool walkthroughs and conversations.</li>
        <li><strong>Series</strong> — multi-part deep dives on a single theme.</li>
        <li><strong>Products</strong> — everything I'm building, in public, with the numbers.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Why "Mind of KV"?</h2>
      <p>Because it's deliberately broad. I don't want to be the "X person" — I want this to be wherever my curiosity goes next, held together by one thread: I build things.</p>
      <h2>Say hello</h2>
      <p>The best way to reach me is a reply to the newsletter, or find me on {SITE.socials.map((s, i) => <>{i > 0 && (i === SITE.socials.length - 1 ? ' or ' : ', ')}<a href={s.href}>{s.label}</a></>)}.</p>
    </div>
    <section style="margin-top:80px"><Newsletter /></section>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>
  .about { display: flex; gap: 32px; align-items: center; max-width: var(--prose); margin: 0 auto; }
  .portrait { flex: none; width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); font: 600 2rem var(--mono); }
  .about h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem); margin-top: 10px; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .about { flex-direction: column; align-items: start; } }
</style>
